INFOTEXT:Races, feats, flaws, fighting styles, arms & equipment, base classes, vestiges, spells, domains and magic items from "The (mostly) Complete Dragon Magazine Compendium", a fan compilation of Dragon Magazine 3.0/3.5 content. SOURCEPAGE refers to the compendium PDF. Athasian races need the Expanded Psionics Handbook; Umbragen needs Complete Arcane; Insectare needs Complete Adventurer; flaws need Unearthed Arcana; vestiges need Tome of Magic.

